  "readme": "# npm-conf [![Build Status](https://travis-ci.org/kevva/npm-conf.svg?branch=master)](https://travis-ci.org/kevva/npm-conf)\n\n> Get the npm config\n\n\n## Install\n\n```\n$ npm install npm-conf\n```\n\n\n## Usage\n\n```js\nconst npmConf = require('npm-conf');\n\nconst conf = npmConf();\n\nconf.get('prefix')\n//=> //=> /Users/unicorn/.npm-packages\n\nconf.get('registry')\n//=> https://registry.npmjs.org/\n```\n\nTo get a list of all available `npm` config options:\n\n```bash\n$ npm config list --long\n```\n\n\n## API\n\n### npmConf()\n\nReturns the `npm` config.\n\n### npmConf.defaults\n\nReturns the default `npm` config.\n\n\n## License\n\nMIT © [Kevin Mårtensson](https://github.com/kevva)\n",
